member.summary:
The title-discovery surface (Milestone 2.3). GET /discover renders a static three-rail Home shell;
GET /discover/rail returns one rail's cards as an HTMX partial. Search (2.4) and Details (2.5) nest
under the same /discover space.

The title-discovery surface (Milestone 2.3). GET /discover renders a static three-rail Home shell;
GET /discover/rail returns one rail's cards as an HTMX partial. Search (2.4) and Details (2.5) nest
under the same /discover space.

The per-card lazy-hydrate FALLBACK (GET /watchlist/control): returns the _WatchlistControl
fragment for one title with the current user's status. The batch status map is the primary path (§5.3);
this endpoint exists for a surface that prefers per-card lazy hydration over the page-level map.
